{
  "topic": "Never answer an offer with いいです",
  "slides": [
    {
      "kind": "cover",
      "label": "NEVER SAY",
      "title": [
        "Offered tea?",
        "Not いいです"
      ],
      "sub": "Yes or no? Your host cannot tell",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "big",
          "text": "いいです",
          "jp": true,
          "size": 150,
          "sub": "after an offer = yes OR no thanks",
          "h": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "rows",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Say yes or no with clearer words",
              "icon": "ok"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "hook": "Offered tea? Never reply with いいです. Your host may not know if that is yes or no."
    },
    {
      "label": "THE SLIP",
      "title": [
        "A host holds",
        "out a cup"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "example",
          "jp": "お茶はいかがですか。",
          "en": "Would you like some tea?",
          "note": "THE OFFER",
          "size": 56
        },
        {
          "type": "example",
          "jp": "いいです。",
          "en": "Good? Or no thanks?",
          "note": "YOUR ANSWER",
          "size": 70
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "THE PROBLEM",
      "title": [
        "Yes and no",
        "in one word"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "rows",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Yes",
              "sub": "that sounds good",
              "icon": "ok",
              "minW": 250
            },
            {
              "text": "No thanks",
              "sub": "I am fine without it",
              "icon": "x",
              "minW": 250
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "rows",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Tone and context decide",
              "icon": "clock",
              "tone": "dim"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "SAY THIS FOR YES",
      "title": [
        "Want the tea?",
        "Say it clearly"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "jp",
          "jp": "はい、お願いします。",
          "reading": "はい、おねがいします",
          "en": "Yes, please.",
          "size": 80
        },
        {
          "type": "jp",
          "jp": "いただきます。",
          "reading": "いただきます",
          "en": "I will gladly have it.",
          "size": 80
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "SAY THIS FOR NO",
      "title": [
        "Want to pass?",
        "Be kind and clear"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "jp",
          "jp": "ありがとうございます。",
          "reading": "ありがとうございます",
          "en": "Thank you.",
          "size": 70
        },
        {
          "type": "jp",
          "jp": "遠慮させていただきます。",
          "reading": "えんりょさせていただきます",
          "en": "I will politely pass.",
          "size": 64
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "THE EXCEPTION",
      "title": [
        "When いいです",
        "really is yes"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "example",
          "jp": "ここに座っても\nいいですか。",
          "en": "May I sit here?",
          "note": "THEY ASK FOR PERMISSION",
          "size": 56
        },
        {
          "type": "example",
          "jp": "はい、いいですよ。",
          "en": "Yes, that is fine.",
          "note": "NOW IT IS A CLEAR YES",
          "size": 56
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "TRY IT",
      "title": [
        "Yes or",
        "no thanks?"
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "example",
          "jp": "もう一杯いかがですか。",
          "en": "Would you like another cup?",
          "note": "THE OFFER",
          "size": 54
        },
        {
          "type": "example",
          "jp": "いいです。",
          "en": "Could be either. Tone decides.",
          "note": "THE ANSWER",
          "size": 64
        },
        {
          "type": "rows",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "So skip it after offers",
              "icon": "ok"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cta",
      "title": [
        "Use it",
        "this week."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "cta",
          "text": "Save it now",
          "icon": "bookmark"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "social": {
    "caption": "Someone offers you tea and you say いいです. Your host may not know if that is yes or no thanks.\n\nいいです (ii desu) after an offer can mean good, or I am fine without it.\n\nFor yes: はい、お願いします (hai, onegai shimasu) = yes, please. いただきます (itadakimasu) = I will gladly have it.\nFor no: ありがとうございます。遠慮させていただきます (enryo sasete itadakimasu) = thank you, I will politely pass.\n\nException: if someone asks いいですか (is it okay?), はい、いいですよ is a clear yes.\n\nSave it now, use it this week.",
    "hashtags": "#LearnJapanese #JapaneseTips #JapanesePhrases #JapaneseManners #JapaneseConversation"
  },
